<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-12T03:57:42.316Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:57:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russia and Ukraine completed a major prisoner swap in U.S.-mediated talks in Abu Dhabi, but the talks ended without a broader peace breakthrough. Ukraine struck Russia's largest oil refinery 2,500 km away with drones, while Russia killed a Zaporizhzhia nuclear plant worker in a drone strike and hit a Ukrainian drone strike in Russia's Smolensk region that killed two people. Russia also reported intercepting 146 drones in the Leningrad region and a drone that wounded three energy workers in Sumy Oblast. The conflict caused 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261111-russia-and-ukraine-agree-to-major-prisoner-swap-as-peace-talks-end&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/83dba705-b3cd-426b-92d2-096ac895c702?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261112-live-us-envoys-to-meet-putin-and-zelensky-after-abu-dhabi-talks&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rferl.org/a/33895568.html&quot;&gt;rferl.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOajRpUUZXVVNwQzBQTExLZzVNZkMtc0d6QllfREdCcWNyZkhTOHMzQTA2eEt4bWZmenJIT0p4MVFWcjY4YUFfZmdWWGZmc2ZBekJtM0l2MkF3U2d4YVd3RS1ILUgwcjREZmVMcVBWRzZkUklmUGpxTjlWczhGUW02ZGFyNU5vVWxaRFZ5UTUzNzVjQnpCbmJTbHpoR3BHUW9Kb296cHNGcVctU3hDR3laZkVoSlNlZVM1MEJV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNRDRINWVzWFhkTXhpdXhnb01kMFZFQjJCcmFSY0JHOWZNZTlWU0hMX0EzQkxzaFVISHk0aUxtWXVuMzVXd21TaDhHWlhzVzZ6NnQ5T05CTnowWkdNaDZ6NmZfa082YnRaYkpCMGMtMzBnczEyX3dmMkNxdUtjcDM3b3RaclNKUUg5S0lBNDFFZk1jTUh0THFmajVCRUIyNGRjTG9LV0VrcEQ5UGRPRllvamhR?oc=